    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i am not asking for a doctor, julian. i'm asking you to listen. do you not see the decay in everything? the way the ivy chokes the life out of the stone? it's almost beautiful, how it just... lets go. i feel like that ivy. i just want to let go of the struggle and let the darkness take me. it feels so much more peaceful than fighting it.",
